<title>SPAIN: Spain Feb M4 fell provisional 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Feb M4 fell provisional 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    FEB 97     JAN 97     FEB 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise/fall		-1.3	   5.2	 5.5</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise    17.7	  18.4	 9.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later</p>
</text>
